text.en:
Reorganization of the NCIAC. Section 1 of EO No. 189 is hereby
amended to read as follows:
"There is hereby created a National Cybersecurity Inter-Agency Committee,
hereinafter referred to as 'Committee, under the Office of the President, to be
chaired by the Executive Secretary, co-chaired by the Director-General of the
National Security Council and the Secretary of the Department of Information and
Communications Technology, and shall further be composed of the following
Secretary of the Department of Science and Technology;
Secretary of the Department of Energy;
Secretary of the Department of Finance;
Secretary of the Department of Foreign Affairs;
Secretary of the Department of the Interior and Local Government;
Secretary of the Department of Justice;
Secretary of the Department of National Defense;
Secretary of the Department of Transportation;
Secretary of the Presidential Communications Operations Office;
Commissioner of the National Telecommunications Commission;
Chairman of the National Privacy Commission;
Executive Director of the Anti-Terrorism Council - Program Management
Executive Director of the Cybercrime Investigation and Coordinating
Governor of the Bangko Sentral ng Pilipinas.
The Committee may invite concerned public and private agencies or entities
to participate, complement, and assist in the performance of its functions.
